nder motherly side too."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asuka saw her at the scene of Yuusuke's death saying that his death was her fault. She's a big fan of of the model Karin Hanamatsuri, one of the heroines in Memories Off ~Sorekara~."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from MAL and translated from the official site."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10459"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/9128d05a7be4edabc3bc5db5e269160a86ecba949209bdc3254ac6c3f6eb2328.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/4616ffd9b3d7c17174c418d8e84e18e52352aba146d241235cf0d0db9118809a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"井ノ上 奈々","creatorId":"vndb:s1808","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1808","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1808","name":"井ノ上奈々","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11927","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c11644","characterName":"稲穂 信","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c11644"},"originalCharacterName":"稲穂 信","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"104"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Memories Off ~Sorekara~:"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A frequenter of the café Narazu-ya and a freeter. He lives on the first floor of the apartment \"Higurashi-sou\"; the same apartment as Isshu. He works part-time at the chain restaurant \"Ressac\" where he continually gets accolades; It's rumored he's due for a big promotion. He's saving up money for his next journey abroad."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Memories Off #5 Togireta Film; Memories Off #5 encore:"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haruto's neighbor at the apartment \"Higurashi-sou.\" After returning from Nepal, Shin returned to working part-time at the chain restaurant \"Ressac\" where he becomes co-workers with Mahiro."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11644"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f3608118ae9d7ad78a124cf7ab3ff089e41d485b8c20c3b75c0600c35b89268.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/067eae24bff43abb4635076e57a7f725a53ca762d72b7b2c2f1fed4e925488f9.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"間島 淳司","creatorId":"vndb:s756","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s756","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s756","name":"間島 淳司","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11923","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c11715","characterName":"日名 あすか","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c11715"},"originalCharacterName":"日名 あすか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"831"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: 17 (in Togireta Film), 18 (in encore)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Fighting games and hot Nata de coco juice."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third-year student at Ayazono high school, and Haruto's kouhai. Asuka is the younger sister of Yuusuke, who was a friend of Haruto's and died a year ago. She has a part-time job at a fast food restaurant. She is a close friend of Miumi, as well as her classmate."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asuka is a bright, friendly and brave girl who sometimes reminds of a little devil. Her lack of sense of direction is catastrophic, she is almost like a deadly machine with no common sense. But once you get used to know her, it's not that critical... Or is it?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was a child actress on TV or doramas but she's no longer in that business."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11715"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b365b5d7e8bd32c664c1b6d41a88ab8d478d6f2d4bda0b9093bddfbe7a5e4cd7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/492950c4e16218debe0eddcfb46ab1f99072828edd1d9ff043d198f876b09106.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野川 さくら","creatorId":"vndb:s1611","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1611","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1611","name":"野川 さくら","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11926","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c11808","characterName":"観島 香月","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c11808"},"originalCharacterName":"観島 香月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1129"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"(20 in Memories Off #5 encore)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Movies and food that tastes like curry."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A Faculty of Arts sophomore at Chihaya University; Kazuki is bullish and unyielding. As soon as she heard about the film Haruto is making, she was determined to work hard on it until it is finished and scolded Haruto and his friends for being lazy to try finishing it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kazuki is easily moved to tears, for example, when watching impressive and dramatic movies she can cry her eyes out..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11808"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7cc08df34d21aa9a81531af97a83e1de9f3bfd9cef8519c80cc302fa2ad87c6b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70b7aa430777ea5d81ebff6b69a9efd44d91e0b4f776e59221ae0beb67576a81.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桑谷 夏子","creatorId":"vndb:s1143","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1143","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1143","name":"桑谷 夏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11924","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c11811","characterName":"河合 春人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c11811"},"originalCharacterName":"河合 春人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityS